Package: wireview-linux
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: wireview-hwmon (>= 1.8.1~), wireview-hwmon-dkms, dfu-util
Description: WireView Pro II Linux GUI application
 Unofficial Linux GUI for the Thermal Grizzly WireView Pro II GPU power
 monitor. Features real-time monitoring with live charts, device
 configuration, data logging with CSV export, desktop notifications,
 and optional software shutdown on fault.
 .
 Supports direct serial and hwmon + daemon connection modes.
 Self-contained binary, no .NET runtime required.
 .
 Includes WireView Mini (wireview-mini), a small program with no window
 that keeps fault alerts, shutdown on fault and LAN publishing going with
 the app closed, with a tray icon and a control panel in the browser.
 wireview-mini --install starts it at login. wireview-hwmon 1.8.1 or later
 takes the LAN port back from it when wireviewd starts after it.
